error[E0477]: a generator's parameter cannot have type 'int32[]'
 --> $DIR/generator-array-parameter.nra:2:31
  |
2 | let numbers = iterator(items: int[]) -> int {
  |                               ^^^^^ this storage belongs to the frame that calls the generator, which a 'yield' outlives
